</rs-module-wrap> </div></div></div></div><div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1724751514821"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-has-fill"><div class="vc_column-inner vc_custom_1724304008232"><div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffffff;"><span style="color: #999999;"><span style="color: #ffffff;">Our Story </span>· <a style="color: #999999;" href="https://superiorrenovations.co.nz/about-us/client-centric-approach/">Approach</a> · <a style="color: #999999;" href="https://superiorrenovations.co.nz/about-us/meet-the-team/">Team</a> · <a style="color: #999999;" href="https://superiorrenovations.co.nz/about-us/partners/">Partners</a> · <a style="color: #999999;" href="https://superiorrenovations.co.nz/about-us/our-promise/">Our Promise</a> · <a style="color: #999999;" href="https://superiorrenovations.co.nz/about-us/become-a-contractor/">Become a Contractor/Supplier</a> · <a style="color: #999999;" href="https://superiorrenovations.co.nz/about-us/careers/">Careers</a></span></span></p> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width"></div><div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1724751539618"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner vc_custom_1557034468170"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="font-size: 40px;color: #0a0a0a;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Personalised process for every client at the heart of everything we do</h2> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p style="text-align: center;">Superior Renovations started with a passion for creating beautiful and functional spaces. Over time, we’ve grown into one of Auckland’s most trusted renovation companies. Our in-house design team crafts every renovation to match your unique style and needs, ensuring that your home feels like it truly belongs to you.</p> <p style="text-align: center;">We’re more than just a renovation company; we’re your partners in turning your house into a home that reflects who you are. We love to push the boundaries and find new ways to make the renovation process better for our clients, because, at the end of the day, it&#8217;s all about you.</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width"></div><div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1724751588551"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner vc_custom_1557034468170"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vc_tta-container" data-vc-action="collapse"><div class="vc_general vc_tta vc_tta-tabs vc_tta-color-grey vc_tta-style-classic vc_tta-shape-rounded vc_tta-spacing-1 vc_tta-tabs-position-top vc_tta-controls-align-left"><div class="vc_tta-tabs-container"><ul class="vc_tta-tabs-list"><li class="vc_tta-tab vc_active" data-vc-tab><a href="#1724751063256-f79d45ab-b38a" data-vc-tabs data-vc-container=".vc_tta"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Our Vision</span></a></li><li class="vc_tta-tab" data-vc-tab><a href="#1724751063268-18d0f3a4-4c79" data-vc-tabs data-vc-container=".vc_tta"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Our Why</span></a></li><li class="vc_tta-tab" data-vc-tab><a href="#1724751111333-2ad811d9-5f4a" data-vc-tabs data-vc-container=".vc_tta"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Commitment to Sustainability</span></a></li><li class="vc_tta-tab" data-vc-tab><a href="#1724751245086-d034d4f3-48d6" data-vc-tabs data-vc-container=".vc_tta"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Treat Your Home Like Our Own</span></a></li></ul></div><div class="vc_tta-panels-container"><div class="vc_tta-panels"><div class="vc_tta-panel vc_active" id="1724751063256-f79d45ab-b38a" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="#1724751063256-f79d45ab-b38a" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Our Vision</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body"><h2 style="font-size: 40px;color: #0a0a0a;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Our Vision</h2> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>At Superior Renovations, our vision is to transform every house into a home where families can create memories, find comfort, and truly express who they are. We aim to lead the renovation industry with innovation, quality, and a client-first approach, ensuring every project reflects our commitment to excellence and personalisation.</p> </div> </div> </div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1724751063268-18d0f3a4-4c79" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="#1724751063268-18d0f3a4-4c79" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Our Why</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body"><h2 style="font-size: 40px;color: #0a0a0a;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Why We Do What We Do - It's Simple</h2> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>At Superior Renovations, we’re driven by a simple but powerful belief: your home should feel like a reflection of you and your family. That’s why we pour our passion into every project, treating each renovation as an opportunity to help you create a space that feels uniquely yours.</p> <p>We know that a home is more than just four walls; it’s a place where life happens. It’s where you gather with loved ones, celebrate milestones, and find peace at the end of a long day. That’s why we focus on transforming houses into homes that are not only beautiful but also functional, welcoming, and personal.</p> <p>We do what we do because we love seeing the joy on our clients’ faces when they step into their newly renovated spaces for the first time. It’s about creating that “wow” moment, where everything feels just right. Whether it’s a complete overhaul or a simple update, our goal is to make sure your renovation experience is as special as the place you call home.</p> </div> </div> </div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1724751111333-2ad811d9-5f4a" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="#1724751111333-2ad811d9-5f4a" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Commitment to Sustainability</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>At Superior Renovations, we believe that creating beautiful spaces goes hand-in-hand with caring for our environment. We’re committed to sustainability in every aspect of our work, from the materials we choose to the way we manage our projects. We strive to minimise our environmental footprint while maximising the quality and longevity of your home.</p> <p>Our approach to sustainability includes sourcing eco-friendly materials that are durable and responsibly produced. We partner with suppliers who share our commitment to ethical practices and environmental stewardship. By selecting high-quality, sustainable products, we ensure that your renovation not only looks great but also stands the test of time, reducing waste and the need for future repairs.</p> <p>We also implement energy-efficient solutions wherever possible, helping you create a home that’s comfortable and environmentally conscious. From energy-saving appliances to sustainable building practices, we’re here to guide you in making choices that benefit both your home and the planet.</p> <p>But sustainability is more than just materials and methods; it&#8217;s about making thoughtful decisions throughout the renovation process. We carefully plan each project to minimise waste and optimise resources, ensuring that every step we take is as green as possible.</p> <p>Our goal is to help you create a home that reflects your values—a space that’s not only beautiful and functional but also sustainable for the long term. At Superior Renovations, we’re proud to be part of a movement towards more responsible and sustainable home renovations. Together, we can create a future where every home is a part of a healthier planet.</p> </div> </div> </div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1724751245086-d034d4f3-48d6" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="#1724751245086-d034d4f3-48d6" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Treat Your Home Like Our Own</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>At Superior Renovations, we understand that your home is more than just a building—it’s where your life happens. That’s why we approach every project with the same care and respect as if it were our own home. From the moment we step through your door to the final touches of your renovation, we handle every detail with the utmost attention and care.</p> <p>We take pride in the trust our clients place in us, and we don’t take that responsibility lightly. Our team is dedicated to ensuring that your home renovation experience is smooth, stress-free, and, most importantly, respectful of your space and time. We protect your home during the renovation process, using best practices to keep things clean, organised, and secure.</p> <p>Every decision we make, from selecting materials to choosing the right contractors, is guided by a commitment to quality and care. We believe that your home deserves nothing less than the best, and we’re dedicated to delivering results that not only meet but exceed your expectations.</p> <p>When you work with Superior Renovations, you’re not just getting a renovation—you’re gaining a partner who truly cares about your home and your satisfaction. We treat your home with the same love and attention to detail that we would want for our own, ensuring that the final result is a space you’re proud to call your own.</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width"></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1464263823580"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="font-size: 30px;color: #0a0a0a;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >A Tailored Experience Just for You</h2></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>At Superior Renovations, you are at the heart of everything we do. We know that renovating your home is a big deal, so we take the time to understand your vision, needs, and budget. Our unique project management approach lets us be flexible and adapt to whatever works best for you, making sure your renovation journey is smooth and enjoyable from start to finish.</p> <p>Whether you want to transform your entire home or just update a single room, our team is here to support you every step of the way. We go above and beyond to make sure you’re thrilled with both the process and the results.</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1464263823580"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="font-size: 30px;color: #0a0a0a;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >A Modern Approach to Renovation</h2></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>The world of renovation is always changing, and so are we. At Superior Renovations, we don’t believe in a one-size-fits-all solution. We handpick the best contractors, suppliers, and project managers to match your specific needs, allowing us to deliver a renovation that is as unique as you are. We’ve renovated over a thousand homes in Auckland, and we approach each new project with the excitement and care as if it were our first.</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1464263823580"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="font-size: 30px;color: #0a0a0a;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Our Promise of Quality</h2></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>Quality is our top priority. From the first meeting to the final reveal, we pay attention to every detail to make sure everything is perfect. Our rigorous quality checks ensure that your renovation not only looks great but also lasts. We want to exceed your expectations and deliver a home that you’ll love for years to come.</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1464263823580"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="font-size: 30px;color: #0a0a0a;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Working with the Best</h2></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>We’ve built strong relationships with some of the best names in the industry. Our partners are top-notch suppliers and specialists who share our commitment to excellence. This means you get the highest quality materials and services available, backed by professionals who care just as much about your home as we do.</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div><div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1724751918517"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="font-size: 40px;color: #0a0a0a;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Treating Your Home<br /> Like Our Own</h2> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p style="text-align: center;">Our Unique Approach To Renovations</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width"></div><div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1557034650663"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>Client experience and their personal stories is at the very heart of Superior Renovations – It is where it all began and is what defines ours systems and processes today – to be client focused and to treat every client as a story of it’s own and not just another transaction. We know that the little things make a big difference.</p> <p>We zero in on those finer touches that really elevate your renovation and make it a quality finish &#8211; it&#8217;s not always about using expensive fittings/materials and hardware. We treat your home like it’s our own, making sure every aspect reflects our commitment to excellence.</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p>Our passion for creating new and exciting spaces in our clients&#8217; homes, coupled with our pursuit of effective project management, stringent quality assurance, and a client-focused approach, forms the dynamic foundation of the exciting renovation company we have today.</p> <p>These principles that form the foundation for the business we have today allows our team to focus on what they do best and what they love doing which is transforming homes and building lasting relationships with every client we come across.</p> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width"></div><div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1557034650663"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"> <div class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left"> <figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure"> <div class="vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="2500" height="1327" src="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Superior-Renovations-Client-Experience-2.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="Superior Renovations Client Experience 2 - Superior Renovations" title="Superior Renovations Client Experience" srcset="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Superior-Renovations-Client-Experience-2.png 2500w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Superior-Renovations-Client-Experience-2-300x159.png 300w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Superior-Renovations-Client-Experience-2-1024x544.png 1024w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Superior-Renovations-Client-Experience-2-768x408.png 768w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Superior-Renovations-Client-Experience-2-1536x815.png 1536w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Superior-Renovations-Client-Experience-2-2048x1087.png 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 2500px) 100vw, 2500px"></div> </figure> </div> </div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width"></div><div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1727431145458"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="font-size: 40px;color: #ffffff;text-align: center;font-family:Raleway;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading vc_custom_1727431280159" >You Are In Very Good Company</h2> <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" > <div class="wpb_wrapper"> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: white;">We have worked with a variety of suppliers forging valuable relationships with a range of reputable experts in their respective fields with a great attitude towards the end result. Not only do these specialists/suppliers deliver to the highest standards, they also share our building philosophy. These associations ensure our clients receive the best possible service from reliable professionals.</span></p> </div> </div> </div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div></div> <div class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center"> <figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure"> <div class="vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="1474" height="880" src="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/SR-partners-2024-3.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="SR partners 2024 3 - Superior Renovations" title="SR-partners-2024" srcset="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/SR-partners-2024-3.png 1474w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/SR-partners-2024-3-300x179.png 300w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/SR-partners-2024-3-1024x611.png 1024w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/superiorrenovations.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/SR-partners-2024-3-768x459.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1474px) 100vw, 1474px"></div> </figure> </div> </div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width"></div> </div> </article> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="footer-sidebar sidebar container"> <ul id="footer-sidebar"> <li id="block-2" class="widget widget_block"> <div class="wp-block-themepunch-revslider revslider" data-modal="false" data-slidertitle="Footer" style=""> 
